\":\"dagbt_residual_memory_v2\",\"program_identity\":\"f0aff02c1983d3be529119bbf33d4e225dfe26049920a63d91aba8d60c30aba9\",\"initial_dag_identity\":\"c21ab4aafc9cd7239476212c67db591d500ad90f10b9ba1c73a99ef86aa3a7dd\"},\"variables\":{\"music_preferences\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"music_preferences\",\"open\":true,\"evidence_semantics\":\"personal_history_summary\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"}}},\"requested_slots\":[\"music_preferences\"],\"requested_scopes\":{\"music_preferences\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"}},\"output_contract\":{\"mode\":\"semantic\",\"result_type\":\"text\",\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\",\"explanation\":\"semantic\"},\"program_revision\":0,\"rule_binding\":null,\"supported_parents\":{},\"known_observations\":[{\"id\":\"fact_dc88ebe3d5b6df48704c9934\",\"stance\":\"support\",\"value\":\"The user has a strong, documented history of actively engaging with and creating music that blends modern electronic beats with traditional Pacific Islander sounds. They have sampled traditional Pacific music in a studio (2013), produced an electronic track fusing these elements, attended a festival featuring Pacific Islander artists, remixed a track with traditional Pacific instruments, joined an online group for Pacific musical innovations, and watched a documentary on the history and modern adaptations of Pacific Islander music. They express deep appreciation for this fusion, describing it as a 'game changer' and a way to connect with their roots and explore creativity.\",\"source_ids\":[\"s24\",\"s45\",\"s22\",\"s46\",\"s4\",\"s56\",\"s26\",\"s3\",\"s5\",\"s57\",\"s47\",\"s11\",\"s58\",\"s23\",\"s25\"],\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\",\"parent_versions\":{},\"retract_ids\":[],\"reason\":\"Multiple user statements across five distinct conversation sessions consistently describe personal experiences with Pacific sounds and modern music: blending traditional Pacific rhythms with modern beats (s3-s5), attending a festival with Pacific Islander artists (s11), sampling and producing electronic tracks with Pacific elements (s22-s26), joining an online group and watching a documentary (s45-s47), and remixing a track with traditional Pacific instruments (s56-s58). These sources collectively establish a sustained personal history of preference and active engagement with this musical fusion.\",\"variable\":\"music_preferences\",\"revoked\":[],\"semantic_status\":\"model_judgment\"}],\"source_spans\":[[\"s3\",\"d1\",105,324,\"User: Using those rhythms alongside traditional Pacific sounds has been a game changer for me. The way these distinct musical influences blend creates an energetic tapestry that captivates both myself and the audience. \",\"user\",[56]],[\"s4\",\"d1\",324,621,\"It’s fascinating how combining traditional instrumentation from the Pacific, like the ukulele or the pahu drum, with the vibrant beats of Latin music can evoke a sense of cultural unity. I've found that each time I experiment with different rhythms, a new world of musical possibilities opens up. \",\"user\",[56]],[\"s5\",\"d1\",621,788,\"Whether it's the intricate syncopation of salsa or the smoothness of bossa nova, the fusion allows me to explore emotional landscapes that resonate on multiple levels.\",\"user\",[56]],[\"s11\",\"d2\",105,442,\"User: I had a spectacular week with music recently! I attended a local electronic music festival that featured some surprising Pacific Islander artists. It was such a delight to see how their traditional sounds merged with modern electronic beats, creating a unique auditory experience that was both familiar and alien at the same time. \",\"user\",[48]],[\"s22\",\"d3\",105,505,\"User: Exactly! In 2013, I sampled various traditional Pacific Islander music in a studio, and it opened my eyes to how I can merge those elements with electronic sounds. The experience was enlightening as I delved into the techniques musicians used and the stories behind each piece. Working with traditional instruments alongside modern technology allowed me to create something fresh and exciting. \",\"user\",[11,12]],[\"s23\",\"d3\",505,749,\"It was a blend that I hadn't fully explored before, and it felt like a natural evolution of my musical style. By immersing myself in the authenticity of those sounds, I was able to pay homage to my roots while also pushing musical boundaries.\\n\\n\",\"user\",[11,12]],[\"s24\",\"d3\",749,973,\"User: This journey led me to produce an electronic track that beautifully blends modern beats with the enchanting sounds of Pacific Islander music, a fusion that reflects my deep appreciation for diverse musical traditions. \",\"user\",[11,12]],[\"s25\",\"d3\",973,1340,\"I spent countless hours experimenting in my home studio, layering samples that resonated with the heart and soul of the Pacific Islands, a place rich with cultural history and vibrant artistry. The experience was transformative, as each beat and melody captured the essence of the tropical landscapes, vibrant dances, and the stories passed down through generations. \",\"user\",[11,12]],[\"s26\",\"d3\",1340,1696,\"The electronic elements added a contemporary twist, making the track something unique that could appeal to both the purists of more traditional genres and the younger crowds who gravitate towards electronic music. This endeavor felt not just like a musical project but a bridge connecting different worlds and celebrating the richness of cultural exchange.\",\"user\",[11,12]],[\"s45\",\"d4\",105,370,\"User: Oh, and I also joined a vibrant online group dedicated to Pacific musical innovations where I exchange ideas with others.\\n\\nUser: Plus, I watched a documentary exploring the history of Pacific Islander music and its modern adaptations, which was enlightening. \",\"user\",[73,74]],[\"s46\",\"d4\",370,665,\"The film delved into various aspects of the music, from traditional rhythms and instruments to the ways in which these sounds have evolved over time. It was fascinating to see how cultural exchanges, historical events, and globalization have shaped the musical landscape of the Pacific Islands. \",\"user\",[73,74]],[\"s47\",\"d4\",665,990,\"The documentary also featured interviews with contemporary musicians who blend traditional elements with modern genres, showcasing the creativity and dynamism of Pacific music today. Overall, it provided a rich context for understanding the significance of music as a form of identity and expression within these communities.\",\"user\",[73,74]],[\"s56\",\"d5\",105,429,\"User: Recently, I remixed a popular track, integrating traditional Pacific instruments, and it felt fantastic to see these sounds come together. The unique timbres of instruments like the ukulele and the Pacific drums really breathed new life into the piece, creating a rich tapestry of sound that resonated deeply with me. \",\"user\",[95]],[\"s57\",\"d5\",429,793,\"I spent hours in the studio experimenting with different harmonies and rhythms, and it was exhilarating to find that perfect balance where the traditional instruments complemented the modern electronic beats. The process reminded me of the vibrant cultural heritage that Pacific music represents, with its stories and rhythms reflecting the beauty of the islands. \",\"user\",[95]],[\"s58\",\"d5\",793,915,\"Overall, it was an experience that not only let me explore my creativity but also connect with my roots in a profound way.\",\"user\",[95]],[\"s139\",\"d6\",1609,1975,\"Assistant: I completely agree; sharing insights with others who share a common passion can be profoundly fulfilling and encourage a more profound exploration of the topics at hand. In many ways, this interchange of thoughts mirrors the collaborative nature of music itself, where different elements are woven together to create something entirely new and beautiful. \",\"assistant\",[102]],[\"s138\",\"d6\",1596,1609,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s140\",\"d6\",1975,2202,\"It’s fascinating how digital platforms have made it easier than ever to connect with individuals from around the globe, allowing for the cross-pollination of ideas that might not have been possible in a more localized setting. \",\"assistant\",[102]],[\"s141\",\"d6\",2202,2417,\"Your creation of a playlist for a local radio station is a fantastic way to channel that inspiration into a tangible outcome, providing a platform for both established and emerging artists to reach wider audiences. \",\"assistant\",[102]],[\"s142\",\"d6\",2417,2754,\"Additionally, crafting a playlist involves not just the selection of songs, but also an understanding of the narrative you wish to convey through the music—you might consider the mood, the flow, and even the context in which the music will be listened to, thereby nurturing an experience that resonates with listeners on multiple levels.\",\"assistant\",[102]]],\"required_scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"},\"rules_completion_required\":false,\"supported_task_outputs\":{},\"personal_response_selection\":true,\"phase\":\"history_evidence\",\"summary_revision_contracts\":{\"music_preferences\":{\"previous_version\":1,\"eligible_route_ids\":[\"fact_dc88ebe3d5b6df48704c9934\"],\"required_source_ids\":[\"s24\",\"s45\",\"s22\",\"s46\",\"s4\",\"s56\",\"s26\",\"s3\",\"s5\",\"s57\",\"s47\",\"s11\",\"s58\",\"s23\",\"s25\"]}},\"source_documents\":{\"d1\":{\"doc_id\":\"personamem:memory:120c2859e739afd048bfa9231d79d830326ecced29d840273b418ef63ef2d908\",\"time_metadata\":{\"observed_start\":56.0,\"observed_end\":57.0,\"event_start\":null,\"event_end\":null,\"validity\":\"unknown\",\"time_source\":\"message_index\"}},\"d2\":{\"doc_id\":\"personamem:memory:81a2d7dd6c8d884879d250ba9f1ec76ce69aac12e96f4f2586f5e4fc9d57c1cd\",\"time_metadata\":{\"observed_start\":48.0,\"observed_end\":49.0,\"event_start\":null,\"event_end\":null,\"validity\":\"unknown\",\"time_source\":\"messa