modern beats with Pacific sounds.\",\"output_slot\":\"response\",\"answer_type\":\"text\",\"inputs\":[\"history_summary\"],\"execution\":\"compose\"},\"grounded_subquestion\":\"I recently attended an event where there was a unique blend of modern beats with Pacific sounds.\\nEstablished history_summary: The user has a well-documented history of attending events, developing music preferences, and cultivating cultural interests centered on the fusion of modern electronic beats with traditional Pacific Islander music. They attended a local electronic music festival featuring Pacific Islander artists and a traditional Pacific music festival in 2012. In 2013, they sampled traditional Pacific music in a studio and produced an electronic track blending those elements. They have also remixed a track with traditional Pacific instruments, joined an online group for Pacific musical innovations, and watched a documentary on the history and modern adaptations of Pacific Islander music. They describe this fusion as a 'game changer' and a way to connect with their roots and explore creativity, and they also find the fusion of Latin music with Pacific instrumentation fascinating. Their interest spans personal creative exploration, live performances, and cultural exchange.\",\"request_context\":{\"query_identity\":\"a1c203b1cadcfaf0776f3415529ab30744f0f4adfefd450b752c09ca6d0fea11\",\"algorithm_version\":\"dagbt_residual_memory_v2\",\"program_identity\":\"f0aff02c1983d3be529119bbf33d4e225dfe26049920a63d91aba8d60c30aba9\",\"initial_dag_identity\":\"c21ab4aafc9cd7239476212c67db591d500ad90f10b9ba1c73a99ef86aa3a7dd\"},\"variables\":{\"attended_events\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"attended_events\",\"open\":true,\"evidence_semantics\":\"personal_history_summary\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"}},\"music_preferences\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"music_preferences\",\"open\":true,\"evidence_semantics\":\"personal_history_summary\",\"scope\":{\"entity_sc